## Summary of Key Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Why |
|----------|--------|-----|
| Query encoder | MiniLM-L6v2 | 50× faster than BGE-M3, adequate for query-level |
| Document encoder | BGE-M3 | Hybrid vectors give +4-8% retrieval over dense-only |
| Vector store | SQLite-VSS | Persistent, single-file, good for 10K-100K vectors |
| Chunking | Semantic + 384 tokens | Preserves meaning, fits model optimal range |
| Cache hit threshold | 0.85 (dense), 0.77 (combined) | Balances freshness vs credit savings |
| Freshness model | Category-based + access-triggered | Avoids unnecessary re-scrapes |
| Storage | ~250MB for 10K pages | Feasible for any dev machine |
